    Builder: one design run at a time, reload-safe
    
    A reload or second tap during 'Design my campaigns' could start a second
    paid run and lost the waiting screen. runOptions now takes an atomic claim
    (tweaks.designing_since, 6-minute lease); a second call gets 409 'designing'.
    The session view exposes designing so the page keeps waiting and polls.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SbHw74RUkAizu4pPDmmPf2

